      "text": {
        "jp": "わかった。ここはお前に任せよう。\r\nだが、無茶はするなよ。",
        "official_en": "Understood, I’ll leave everything to your discretion. Just be careful not to take any unnecessary risks.",
        "real_en": "All right. I'll leave this to you. But don't do anything reckless."
