      "text": {
        "jp": "調査が優先だ。危険を感じたら退いてくれ。",
        "official_en": "We’re only here to check that everything is in order. Be ready to fall back if you sense danger.",
        "real_en": "The investigation comes first. Fall back if you sense danger."
